        "rationale": "Round 1 reduced loss from 405.08 to 6.526 with zero mismatches. Inspecting the published drillhole distribution showed 51 positive versus 15 negative labels; the broad affine trend was also overreacting to the isolated fourth hole in the transverse direction. Regularizing that slope and shifting the broad trend by 0.5 vertical cell better preserves distance along the labelled columns. Public selfcheck passes, and the public objective recomputation improves to loss 6.51813 with zero mismatches and contact RMSE 0.270."
